	(descr "Prismatic (rectangular can) electric double-layer supercapacitor module, vertical mount. Body 13.0 (W) x 7.0 (cell dia) mm cross-section x 28.5 mm tall, two straight radial leads on 10.00 mm pitch. Drawn for CDA/Zhifengwei CHP5R5L205R-TWQ (2.0 F, 5.5 V; ESR 190 mohm @1 kHz / ~380 mohm DC, per the CHP 5.5V series table; DigiKey-stocked). Dimensions and 10.00 mm lead spacing per the DigiKey listing (13 x 7 x 28.5 mm). Lead diameter 0.6 mm assumed from the CHP series family table; drill 0.9 mm gives 0.3 mm clearance. Pad 1 = POSITIVE. Datasheet: CDA CHP(5.5V) Series, spec date 2022-05-17.")
